00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:35.260
But then we started to put together a bunch
of different things that took place.

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:40.360
And from further back, we had, of course,
getting out of Afghanistan, which was an absolutely

00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:41.360
fantastic decision.

00:00:41.360 --> 00:00:42.360
Did it go perfectly?

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:44.610
