00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:06.680
Inflation is down.

00:01:06.680 --> 00:01:09.010
Gas prices have been steadily coming down.

00:01:09.010 --> 00:01:13.000
And significantly, we've had the PACT Act
signed.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:16.080
The Inflation Reduction Act has been signed.

00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:20.700
We've got the older infrastructure bill, which
Biden did.

00:01:20.700 --> 00:01:24.970
And then on the other side, look at what's
happening for the right wing.

00:01:24.970 --> 00:01:28.460
The revelations from the January six committee
disastrous.

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:34.570
Disastrous for Trump and people around him,
completely bonkers MAGA nominees.

