00:01:44.010 --> 00:01:48.370
Roe v Wade overturned something the right
has wanted for so long.

00:01:48.370 --> 00:01:50.460
Absolutely horrifying.

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:56.010
Trump busted with documents at his house,
